ess/)\n\n[Investors](https://www.starhealth.in/investors/about-us/)\n\n[Lab Login](https://portal.starhealth.in/lab/)\n\n[Quality Policy](https://www.starhealth.in/quality-management-policy/)\n\n[Sitemap](https://www.starhealth.in/sitemap/)\n\nLegal\n\n[Disclaimer](https://www.starhealth.in/disclaimer/)\n\n[Privacy](https://www.starhealth.in/privacy-policy/)\n\n[Terms Of Usage](https://www.starhealth.in/terms-of-usage/)\n\n[Safe Buying](https://www.starhealth.in/disclaimer/safebuying/)\n\n[Vulnerability Disclosure Guidelines](https://www.starhealth.in/vulnerability-disclosure-program/)\n\nStar Health and Allied Insurance Co Ltd\n\nRegistered Office: No 1, New Tank Street, Valluvarkottam High Road, Nungambakkam, Chennai 600034\n\nIRDAI Registration No: 129 \\| CIN : L66010TN2005PLC056649 \\| Ph: 044-28288800 \\| Fax: 044-28260062 \\| Email: info@starhealth.in \\| Website: [www.starhealth.in](https://www.starhealth.in/)\n\nToll Free Number -1800-425-2255 / 1800-102-4477 \\| Corporate Customers - 044 43664666\n\nAddress of IRDAI:\n\nInsurance Regulatory And Development Authority Of India\n\n\nSy No. 115/1, Financial District, Nanakramguda, Gachibowli, Hyderabad \u2013 500032 Website: [https://irdai.gov.in](https://irdai.gov.in/)"}}, "step8_PythonRepl2": {"step": 8, "title": "Python Execution: \ndef parse_indian(s):\n    return int(s.replace(',', ''))\n\nvals = {\n 'GWP_direct_th': \"12,95,24,711\",...", "toolName": "PythonRepl", "snippet": "Output: \"GWP_direct_th 129524711 12952.47 crore\\nNet_Premium_th 123196419 12319.64 crore\\nNEP_th 112615949 11261.59 crore\\nPAT_th 6185922 618.59 crore\\nClaims_incurred_th 73204042 7320.4 crore\\nCommission_th ...", "raw_data": {"code": "\ndef parse_indian(s):\n    return int(s.replace(',', ''))\n\nvals = {\n 'GWP_direct_th': \"12,95,24,711\",\n 'Net_Premium_th': \"12,31,96,419\",\n 'NEP_th': \"11,26,15,949\",\n 'PAT_th': \"61,85,922\",\n 'Claims_incurred_th': \"7,32,04,042\",\n 'Commission_th': \"1,68,27,717\",\n 'Opex_th': \"2,05,38,085\",\n 'ShareCap_th': \"58,16,773\",\n 'Reserves_th': \"5,98,38,661\",\n 'ShareholdersInv_th': \"5,34,58,643\",\n 'PolicyholdersInv_th': \"8,04,62,380\",\n}\n\nfor k,v in vals.items():\n    n = parse_indian(v)\n    cr = n*1000/1e7  # thousand rupees -> crore\n    print(k, n, round(cr,2), \"crore\")\n\nprint(\"Commission ratio %\", round(parse_indian(vals['Commission_th'])/parse_indian(vals['Net_Premium_th'])*100,2))\nprint(\"Claims ratio %\", round(parse_indian(vals['Claims_incurred_th'])/parse_indian(vals['NEP_th'])*100,2))\nprint(\"AUM total crore\", round((parse_indian(vals['ShareholdersInv_th'])+parse_indian(vals['PolicyholdersInv_th']))*1000/1e7,2))\n", "result": "\"GWP_direct_th 129524711 12952.47 crore\\nNet_Premium_th 123196419 12319.64 crore\\nNEP_th 112615949 11261.59 crore\\nPAT_th 6185922 618.59 crore\\nClaims_incurred_th 73204042 7320.4 crore\\nCommission_th 16827717 1682.77 crore\\nOpex_th 20538085 2053.81 crore\\nShareCap_th 5816773 581.68 crore\\nReserves_th 59838661 5983.87 crore\\nShareholdersInv_th 53458643 5345.86 crore\\nPolicyholdersInv_th 80462380 8046.24 crore\\nCommission ratio % 13.66\\nClaims ratio % 65.0\\nAUM total crore 13392.1\\n\""}}}</sources>
